### ✅ Crear cita correcta
POST {{BackendSpa_HostAddress}}/api/citas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCliente": "Edgar",
  "email": "edgar@gmail.com",
  "telefono": "+5213312566287",
  "fecha": "2026-07-21",
  "horaInicio": "8:00:00",
  "idServicios": [1]
}

###

